@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide footbox
actor Student
boundary UI
control Reservation
control Core
title S3 - Return (Core API v1.1, D-015/D-018)
control "Allocation (M4 provider)" as Allocation
Student -> UI: Confirm return Hub
UI -> Reservation: Trip ID, Hub, optional parking hold, vehicle version
Reservation -> Reservation: Validate actor; read owned Trip / Reservation first
alt Completed Trip with matching destination
  Reservation --> UI: Recorded receipt; no relocation or second completion
else Owned open Trip
  Reservation -> Core: Enter core.unit_of_work()
  group One repository transaction under Core lock
    Reservation -> Reservation: Reread Trip / Reservation; check owner and state
    Reservation -> Core: get_vehicle(); get_config().as_of
    Core --> Reservation: Current vehicle and authoritative time
    Reservation -> Core: transition_vehicle(RETURN or RETURN_FAULTY, version,\nTransitionCtx(hub_id, optional own claim_id))
    Core -> Core: Validate destination; select safe unclaimed space\nor consume valid own space hold; check future claims
    alt Safe receiving space
      Core -> Core: Occupy destination; update vehicle location\nVehicle Returned / Maintenance; record audit events
      Core --> Reservation: Vehicle result
      Reservation -> Reservation: Complete Trip / Reservation via uow.repository\nComplete matching M2 return-parking booking if used
      Reservation -> Core: uow.commit()
      Core --> Reservation: Commit result
    else No space or conflict
      Core --> Reservation: Err; exit without commit (full rollback)
    end
  end
  opt Capacity rejection
    Reservation -> Core: providers.call(ALTERNATIVE_HUB, read-only query)
    Core -> Allocation: Rank alternatives
    Allocation --> Core: Candidates with as_of / unavailable
    Core --> Reservation: Advisory result; no holds
  end
  Reservation --> UI: Receipt or mapped error / alternatives
end
UI --> Student: Completed, or select another Hub
note over Reservation,Core
  No parking: Trip stays open and Reservation stays Active.
  Matching retry reads M2 receipt before checking stale vehicle version.
  M3 readiness after return is separate from completion.
end note
@enduml
